WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:17.397
"I heard a monster!" Dipper cried.

2
00:00:17.398 --> 00:00:20.627
"Let's get out of here!"

3
00:00:20.627 --> 00:00:23.940
"Don't go!" a voice cried.

4
00:00:23.941 --> 00:00:27.028
"Who said that?" Eddy asked.

5
00:00:27.028 --> 00:00:29.833
"Look!" Poppy said.

6
00:00:29.834 --> 00:00:40.597
"Someone is behind that tire pile."

7
00:00:40.598 --> 00:00:46.472
A truck peeked out.

8
00:00:46.472 --> 00:00:49.957
He had really big tires.

9
00:00:49.957 --> 00:00:53.269
Dipper gasped.

10
00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.433
"A monster!" she cried.

11
00:00:56.433 --> 00:00:58.854
"Let's go!"

12
00:00:58.862 --> 00:01:01.703
"Wait!" the truck called.

13
00:01:01.704 --> 00:01:03.962
"I'm a monster truck.

14
00:01:03.962 --> 00:01:09.087
But I'm very friendly."

15
00:01:09.088 --> 00:01:16.572
Dipper gulped.

16
00:01:16.572 --> 00:01:19.737
"He looks nice," she whispered.

17
00:01:19.737 --> 00:01:27.130
"My name is Gasser," the truck said.

18
00:01:27.130 --> 00:01:32.366
"It's nice to meet you, Gasser," Eddy said.

19
00:01:32.367 --> 00:01:35.056
"Do you live here?"

20
00:01:35.057 --> 00:01:37.737
"Yes," said Gasser.

21
00:01:37.737 --> 00:01:40.590
"My family just moved here.

22
00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:45.022
Want to see something cool?"

23
00:01:45.022 --> 00:01:53.898
Brumm, brumm!

24
00:01:53.899 --> 00:01:59.155
Gasser sped toward a junk pile.

25
00:01:59.156 --> 00:02:03.191
"Look out, Gasser!" Eddy cried.

26
00:02:03.192 --> 00:02:09.300
"You're going to crash!"
